<p>The business setup fee breakdown saudi arabia 2026 for joint ventures includes partnership agreement drafting at SAR 8,000-15,000, notarization fees, and potential capital certification requirements by certified accountants.</p>
<h2>Office Space and Physical Setup Costs</h2>
