<p>Minimum opening deposits range SAR 10,000-100,000 depending on bank and business activity. International banks operating in Saudi Arabia typically require higher minimums than local institutions.</p>
<p>Monthly maintenance fees run SAR 100-500 for standard business accounts. Transaction fees apply per transfer, with domestic transfers costing SAR 5-20 and international wires costing SAR 100-200 plus correspondent bank charges.</p>
