<p>Review audit logs monthly to detect unauthorized access attempts or suspicious activities. Report security incidents to platform support immediately.</p>
<h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Absher Business Platform Registration Guide</h2>
<h3>Q: How long does Absher Business registration take after submitting the application?</h3>
<p><strong>A:</strong> Registration typically completes within 24 hours if all prerequisite requirements are met. The system processes applications automatically once it validates your <strong>commercial registration</strong> data against Ministry of Commerce records. Delays occur when preliminary registrations remain incomplete or information mismatches exist.</p>
<h3>Q: Can foreign investors register on Absher Business without Saudi partners?</h3>
<p><strong>A:</strong> Yes, foreign investors with valid <strong>MISA investment licenses</strong> can register independently if their business structure allows 100% foreign ownership. The authorized signatory\'s Iqama must be linked to the company\'s <strong>commercial registration KSA</strong>. Some restricted sectors still require Saudi partnership regardless of MISA approval.</p>
<h3>Q: What happens if my Commercial Registration expires before Absher Business registration completes?</h3>
<p><strong>A:</strong> You cannot register on Absher Business with an expired CR. Renew your <strong>commercial registration</strong> through Ministry of Commerce first, then proceed with platform registration. Operating with expired registration triggers penalties and prevents processing any government services including employee permits or tax submissions.</p>
<h3>Q: Do I need separate registrations for multiple branches under one CR?</h3>
<p><strong>A:</strong> No, all branches under a single <strong>commercial registration</strong> number use one unified Absher Business account. The platform displays all registered branch locations. However, each branch location requires proper licensing and registration with Ministry of Commerce before appearing in your Absher Business profile and connected systems.</p>
