<td>Under Review</td>
<td>Ministry reviewing your documents</td>
<td>Wait 2-3 business days</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Pending Corrections</td>
<td>Documents require amendments</td>
<td>Check notes, resubmit</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Approved</td>
