<h2>Step-by-Step Process: Paying Your Chamber Membership Fees</h2>
<p>Understanding the payment process prevents last-minute complications during renewal periods. Chamber fees must be paid before your CR anniversary date to avoid lapses in legal standing. The process has become streamlined through digital platforms but still requires careful attention to deadlines.</p>
