<h3>Articles of Association Drafting Costs</h3>
<p>Drafting your <strong>Articles of Association</strong> requires legal expertise in Saudi commercial law. Basic templates cost SAR 2,000-4,000 but rarely suit complex ownership structures or specific industry requirements.</p>
<p>Custom-drafted Articles of Association addressing foreign ownership restrictions, Saudization obligations, and profit distribution mechanisms range from SAR 5,000-12,000. Multi-shareholder structures with preferential rights or vesting schedules increase complexity and cost.</p>
