<h2>Future Cost Trajectory: What to Expect Beyond 2026</h2>
<p>Vision 2030\'s ongoing implementation suggests continued cost optimization. Planned initiatives include further digitalization of remaining manual processes and additional sector liberalization. The government repeatedly signals commitment to competitive business environments that attract international investment. This policy direction indicates stable or decreasing regulatory costs rather than reversal toward pre-2020 structures.</p>
