<li><strong>Minimum balance requirement</strong>: SAR 50,000 to SAR 100,000</li>
<li><strong>Monthly maintenance</strong>: SAR 100 to SAR 300</li>
<li><strong>Transaction fees</strong>: SAR 2 to SAR 10 per transaction</li>
</ul>
<p>The minimum balance remains frozen during the first year and cannot be used for operations. This requirement effectively increases your capital needs by the frozen amount.</p>
<p>Different banks offer varying service packages for corporate clients. Choosing the appropriate bank depends on your transaction volume, international transfer needs, and preferred banking platform features.</p>
<h3>Payment Gateway and Electronic Services</h3>
<p>Electronic commerce requires payment gateway integration. Setup costs range from <strong>SAR 2,000 to SAR 5,000</strong> with monthly fees between SAR 300 and SAR 800 based on transaction volume.</p>
<p><strong>ZATCA registration</strong> for electronic invoicing is now mandatory. Compliance software subscriptions cost <strong>SAR 200 to SAR 600 monthly</strong> depending on transaction volume and integration requirements. This expense continues throughout your operational lifetime.</p>
<p><strong>Motaded assists with bank account opening</strong> by providing required corporate documentation packages and coordinating bank appointments. We maintain relationships with major Saudi banks that streamline the account activation process.</p>
<h2>Government Portal Fees and Platform Access</h2>
