</ul>
<p>Each platform requires separate registration with your CR number. Setup involves document uploads, verification waiting periods, and administrator designation. The initial configuration process takes 2-3 weeks across all platforms.</p>
<p>Transaction-based fees on Qiwa include <strong>SAR 100 per work visa issuance</strong> and <strong>SAR 50 per visa transfer</strong>. These costs accumulate rapidly during initial hiring phases when building your workforce.</p>
<h3>Tax Registration and Compliance Software</h3>
<p><strong>ZATCA registration</strong> for VAT is mandatory for businesses expecting annual revenues exceeding SAR 375,000. Registration itself is free, but maintaining compliance requires accounting software with ZATCA-approved electronic invoicing capabilities.</p>
<p>Approved software subscriptions range from <strong>SAR 300 to SAR 1,200 monthly</strong> based on features and user counts. Cloud-based solutions typically cost more but offer automatic updates ensuring ongoing compliance with regulation changes.</p>
