<p>Visa processing for expatriate employees costs <strong>SAR 2,000 per employee</strong> including medical examinations, documentation processing, and permit fees. Initial residence permit issuance adds <strong>SAR 650 per dependent</strong> for family sponsorship.</p>
<p><strong>GOSI contributions</strong> equal nine percent of gross salary for companies and nine percent covered by employees. Your company pays eighteen percent for Saudi nationals and two percent for expatriates, representing significant monthly obligations.</p>
