<h2>Common Application Challenges and Solutions</h2>
<p>Technology companies frequently encounter specific obstacles during MISA licensing. Inadequate technical documentation remains the leading cause of application delays, particularly when businesses fail to clearly articulate their technology stack, security measures, or service delivery methodology.</p>
<p>Capital structure misalignment creates complications when declared amounts appear insufficient for stated operational scope. For example, a cloud infrastructure company claiming to serve enterprise clients with minimal capital raises evaluator concerns about operational viability.</p>
<h3>Addressing ISIC Code Selection Issues</h3>
