<p><strong>A:</strong> MISA approval typically takes one to three weeks depending on sector complexity and documentation completeness. CR issuance through Eonot usually takes three to five business days after submission. Combined, expect three to four weeks from MISA application to CR receipt when managed professionally.</p>
<h3>Q: Do I need to renew both MISA license and CR annually?</h3>
<p><strong>A:</strong> Commercial registrations require annual renewal through the Ministry of Commerce portal. MISA licenses typically remain valid as long as your business operates, though amendments may be necessary for ownership or activity changes. Always verify specific renewal requirements with current regulations.</p>
