<p><strong>A:</strong> Complete e-commerce licensing typically requires four to eight weeks from initial application to operational readiness. Timeline variations depend on document preparation quality, supplementary approvals for specific product categories, and office lease arrangements. Professional consultants compress timelines significantly.</p>
