<p><strong>A:</strong> Standard commercial activity amendments process within 1-3 business days through Markaz. Regulated activities requiring sector-specific approvals extend timelines to 5-15 business days or longer depending on regulatory coordination requirements and documentation completeness.</p>
<h3>Q: Can I operate under new activities immediately after submitting a CR amendment?</h3>
<p><strong>A:</strong> No, you must receive MoC approval and your amended CR certificate before conducting business under new activities. Operating without proper CR registration constitutes a regulatory violation subject to penalties and potential business suspension by authorities.</p>
