<p><strong>Branch Manager Authority Limitations:</strong> The power of attorney granted to branch managers must clearly define authority limits. Overly restrictive powers prevent normal business operations, while excessively broad authority creates compliance concerns. Balancing operational flexibility with control requirements needs careful legal drafting.</p>
<p><strong>Capital Transfer Complications:</strong> International capital transfers face regulatory scrutiny from both source country and Saudi banking authorities. Transfer delays postpone CR application submission. Pre-arranged banking channels expedite the process significantly.</p>
