<p>Processing time ranges from immediate approval for straightforward cases to several weeks when additional verification is required. Applications submitted with complete documentation and immediate penalty payment receive priority processing.</p>
<h2>Long-Term Consequences Beyond Financial Penalties</h2>
<p>Extended CR expiration creates permanent records in government compliance databases. Future license applications, contract bids, and regulatory approvals face increased scrutiny when your compliance history shows expiration periods. This affects your company\'s risk rating across multiple government platforms.</p>
<p>Companies planning expansions or additional business activities find prior CR expiration delays approval for new registrations. The Ministry of Commerce may require additional guarantees or impose stricter monitoring conditions on businesses with compliance violations.</p>
