<p><strong>Saudization compliance</strong> through the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Development\'s <strong>Nitaqat</strong> system becomes mandatory once you begin hiring employees. Your entity receives a Nitaqat classification determining employment visa quotas based on your Saudi-to-foreign employee ratios. Foreign-owned companies often face challenges achieving favorable classifications in initial operational years.</p>
