<p>Duplicate CR certificates hold identical legal weight to original documents. The Ministry of Commerce issues replacements with the same registration number, business details, and validity period as your initial certificate.</p>
<p><strong>Saudi commercial regulations</strong> recognize duplicates for all official purposes. Courts accept them as evidence, ZATCA registration systems validate them, and banking institutions process them without additional authentication requirements.</p>
<h2>Eligibility Requirements for CR Duplicate Certificate Requests</h2>
<p>Only authorized individuals can request replacement CR certificates. Business owners with active <strong>Commercial Registration</strong> numbers qualify immediately. Company managers listed in the Ministry of Commerce database as authorized signatories also meet eligibility criteria.</p>
<p>Foreign investors holding <strong>MISA investment licenses</strong> can request duplicates through their registered Saudi representatives. Branch office managers require head office authorization letters to initiate replacement requests.</p>
